* cics-crucible commarea-mismatch / ca-address-cwa
DEFINE PROGRAM(CACWAD) GROUP(CRUCCAA) LANGUAGE(COBOL)
DEFINE PROGRAM(CACWSB) GROUP(CRUCCAA) LANGUAGE(COBOL)
* CA0K and CA0L run the same program; the CWA is the region's, not a transaction's
DEFINE TRANSACTION(CA0K) GROUP(CRUCCAA) PROGRAM(CACWAD)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(CA0L) GROUP(CRUCCAA) PROGRAM(CACWAD)
DEFINE TYPETERM(CRU3278) GROUP(CRUCCAA) DEVICE(3270) TERMMODEL(2)
       ATI(YES) TTI(YES)
DEFINE TERMINAL(T001) GROUP(CRUCCAA) TYPETERM(CRU3278)
